OL,5,G1400 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FWith a surge in criminals using
OL,7,     Ffake car number plates to commit
OL,8,     Fcrimes, Traffic Cops are under
OL,9,     Fpressure to locate these cloned
OL,10,     Fcars and catch criminals trying to
OL,11,     Ffly under the radar.
OL,12,G1500 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FPolice hunt a man wanted on
OL,14,     Fsuspicion of stalking, but the
OL,15,     Foperation spirals into a standoff.
OL,16,     FAnd officers head to remote
OL,17,     Fwoodland, where a wanted man is
OL,18,     Fbelieved to be in hiding.
